484 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Experience\050\nFreelance \050selected clients\051 \050\nPleo \174 Designer  \174 Feb 2026 \023 Present \174 Berlin\054 Hybrid\050 Contributing to Pleo\047s expansion into enterprise multi\055entity spend management\054 shaping onboarding and admin experiences within an AI\055driven product and design process\056\050\nZalando \174 Designer  \174 Feb 2025 \023 Aug 2025 \174 Berlin\054 Hybrid\050 Contributed to the transition from transactional e\055commerce to inspiration\055led discovery\054 shaping product direction beyond purchase flows\056\050\nGrab \174 Designer \174 Aug 2023 \023 Nov 2024 \174 Singapore\054 Remote\050 Led research and early concept development for future\055facing driver experiences and food discovery\054 exploring new interaction models across mobility and consumer services\056\050\nSonnen \174 Designer \174 Jan 2022 \023 May 2023 \174 Berlin\050 Improved B2B web platforms for the partner ecosystem\054 enabling more efficient commissioning\054 servicing\054 and scaling of PV battery systems\056\050\nTaxfix \174 Designer \174 May 2020 \023 Jun 2021\050 Led design and research for the Italian market launch\054 helping define product direction and validate solutions for local users\056\n\050In\055house \050\nDesignit \174 Senior UX Designer \174 2018 \023 2020\050 Led multidisciplinary teams on complex service and product challenges across mobility\054 finance\054 and consumer domains\054 delivering end\055to\055end digital products for large organisations\056\050\nB\055Reel \174 Senior UX Designer \174 2017 \023 2018\050 Designed and shipped interactive web experiences for global brands\054 translating creative concepts into high\055quality\054 production\055ready digital products\056\050\nHERE \174 Interaction Designer \174 2015 \023 2017\050 Designed interaction and sound experiences for embedded automotive navigation systems \050Jaguar XF\051\054 and developed multiscreen\054 multimodal\054 and sound design concepts for autonomous driving scenarios\056\050\nServices\050\nProduct strategy \046 problem framing \024 Defining what to build and why through product vision\054 value propositions\054 MVP definition\054 and informed decision\055making\056\050\nExperience \046 interaction design \024 Designing clear\054 usable product experiences with strong attention to interaction\054 behavior\054 and multimodal systems\056\050\nDelivery\054 validation \046 collaboration \024 Hands\055on design from concept to release\054 working closely with founders and product teams through prototyping\054 testing\054 and iteration\056\n\nEducation\050\nMSc Media Technology \024 Aalborg University\054 Copenhagen \050DK\051\050Master\047s thesis with maximum grade \05012\05712\051\050\nBA Sound Engineering \024 Conservatorio Cesare Pollini\054 Padua \050IT\051\050Final thesis with maximum grade \050110\057110\054 with honours\051\n\nSkills\050\nProduct Design \267 Product Strategy \267 UX Research \267 Interaction Design \267 Prototyping \267 Design Systems \267 Sound Interaction Design \267 Multimodal Design)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 485 0 R
     /Pg 478 0 R
     /S /Span
